<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

    <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">

    <title>My Notes</title>
</head>
<body>

    <nav class="navbar">

        <a href="index.html" class="logo">
            Note<span>Space</span>
        </a>

        <a href="create.html" class="nav-link">
            + New Note
        </a>

    </nav>


    <main class="notes-page">

        <div class="notes-header">

            <div>
                <p class="tag">✦ YOUR COLLECTION</p>

                <h1>
                    All your
                    <span>notes.</span>
                </h1>

                <p>
                    Everything you've written, all in one place.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="note-count">
                <strong>03</strong>
                <span>NOTES</span>
            </div>

        </div>


        <section class="notes-grid">


            <article class="note-card">

                <div class="note-card-top">
                    <span>01</span>
                    <span>OCT 04, 2026</span>
                </div>

                <h2>
                    Things I want to learn
                </h2>

                <p>
                    Backend development, databases, authentication,
                    APIs and building real-world applications.
                </p>

                <div class="note-card-bottom">
                    <span>03 min read</span>
                    <button>→</button>
                </div>

            </article>


            <article class="note-card">

                <div class="note-card-top">
                    <span>02</span>
                    <span>OCT 03, 2026</span>
                </div>

                <h2>
                    Project Ideas
                </h2>

                <p>
                    Build small projects to understand individual
                    backend concepts before starting bigger projects.
                </p>

                <div class="note-card-bottom">
                    <span>02 min read</span>
                    <button>→</button>
                </div>

            </article>


            <article class="note-card">

                <div class="note-card-top">
                    <span>03</span>
                    <span>OCT 02, 2026</span>
                </div>

                <h2>
                    EJS Concepts
                </h2>

                <p>
                    Learn template rendering, variables, loops,
                    conditions and passing data from Express.
                </p>

                <div class="note-card-bottom">
                    <span>04 min read</span>
                    <button>→</button>
                </div>

            </article>


            <a href="create.html" class="add-note-card">

                <div class="plus">+</div>

                <h2>
                    Create another note
                </h2>

                <p>
                    Got something new to write?
                </p>

            </a>


        </section>

    </main>

</body>
</html>